cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Entropy cannot tell electric tides from magnetic ones. Area can. An exact second-order mismatch for free gravitons in a flat ball"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Houg
    given-names: Andreas
date-released: 2026-11-10
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: "Exact comparison, in free linearised gravity on a flat ball, of the relative entropy of a graviton tidal state with the second-order change of the stationary value of Area minus twice Volume. They agree on static electric multipoles and differ by the factor (l+1)/(l+2) on stationary magnetic multipoles. Proofs, pre-registrations and rerunnable checks."
keywords:
  - linearised gravity
  - relative entropy
  - modular theory
  - causal diamonds
  - entanglement equilibrium
license: MIT
